@methods: old_choice
# The methods of the stage old_choice as an addition to old_choice.bl: the
# discrete maximum over staying in business and retiring (equation (10) of the
# paper) on the policy builder, the identity for the measure the arrival
# builder carries to the decision perch, and the deterministic transition of
# the decision builder, which branches over the control d. No method adds a
# line, so every selection is a file-level line routed by its path (rule 7).

policy.method : !max
arvl_to_dcsn.method : !identity
dcsn_to_cntn.method : !deterministic    # no form in §4: on: dcsn_to_cntn, method: !deterministic, the method slot of a block whose body is two labeled branches
